cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MHD Neural Operator: a Fourier Neural Operator surrogate for the magnetized Kelvin-Helmholtz instability"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Monti
    given-names: Lorenzo
    email: monti.lorenzo00@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/LoreMonti/MHD_Neural_Operator"
abstract: >-
  A Fourier Neural Operator trained to emulate the nonlinear evolution of a
  magnetized Kelvin-Helmholtz instability in 2D incompressible
  magnetohydrodynamics, together with the from-scratch pseudo-spectral solver
  that generates its ground truth. The training set deliberately excludes a band
  of Alfvenic Mach number around the magnetic stabilization threshold, so that
  recovering the threshold there tests physical generalization rather than
  interpolation.
keywords:
  - neural operator
  - Fourier neural operator
  - magnetohydrodynamics
  - Kelvin-Helmholtz instability
  - scientific machine learning
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
